section.position-relative.text-white
  div
    span.tt(data-bs-placement='bottom' data-tooltip='Tap that Button!!!')
      img.image.d-block(src='/public/images/some-cute-hero.jpg' alt='Young4Chicks')
  .position-absolute.top-50.start-50.translate-middle.text-center.p-3(style='background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);')
    h1 We&apos;re More Than Just Chicks
    h3 Young4Chicks is building a movement of young farmers across Uganda and beyond
    p
      | Founded by youth, for youth, Our platform empowers you to raise, sell, and thrive in the poultry business. We
      | believe in skills, innovation, and community. Learn more about how we started and why we&rsquo;re committed to
      | transforming agriculture for a new generation.
    a(href='signup.html')
      button Register With Us
section#topics
  .container-md
    .text-center
      h2 Who We Are
      p.lead.text-muted
        | Behind every great endeavor is a story, a purpose, and a dream. Ours is rooted in our
        | founding history, propelled by our mission, and illuminated by our vision for what&apos;s possible. Together, these
        | elements shape our identity and guide our journey, inspiring us to strive for excellence and push beyong
        | boundaries.
    .row.my-5.g-5.justify-content-around.align-items-center
      // Accordion
      .col-6.col-lg-4
        #chapters.accordion
          .accordion-item
            h2#heading-1.accordion-header
              button.accordion-button(type='button' data-bs-toggle='collapse' data-bs-target='#chapter-1' aria-expanded='true' aria-controls='chapter-1')
                | Founding Story
            #chapter-1.accordion-collapse.collapse.show(aria-labelledby='heading-1' data-bs-parent='#chapters')
              .accordion-body
                p
                  | Young4chicks was born out of a passion to support small-scale farmers and poultry enthusiasts. Our
                  | founder, Mutebi Phoebe, recognized the challenges faced by the industry and set out to create a
                  | platform that would connect people, provide valuable resources, and promote sustainable practices.
          .accordion-item
            h2#heading-2.accordion-header
              button.accordion-button.collapsed(type='button' data-bs-toggle='collapse' data-bs-target='#chapter-2' aria-expanded='false' aria-controls='chapter-2')
                | Mission
            #chapter-2.accordion-collapse.collapse(aria-labelledby='heading-2' data-bs-parent='#chapters')
              .accordion-body
                p
                  | Revolutionizing the poultry industry by providing a seamless platform for buying, selling, and
                  | exchanging knowledge.
          .accordion-item
            h2#heading-3.accordion-header
              button.accordion-button.collapsed(type='button' data-bs-toggle='collapse' data-bs-target='#chapter-3' aria-expanded='false' aria-controls='chapter-3')
                | Vision
            #chapter-3.accordion-collapse.collapse(aria-labelledby='heading-3' data-bs-parent='#chapters')
              .accordion-body
                p
                  | To become the leading platform for poultry farming and trade, fostering a community that values
                  | innovation, sustainability, and mutual growth.
      // Image SECOND (on the right)
      .col-6.col-lg-4
        img.img-fluid(src='/public/images/hero-for-something.jpg' alt='epig')
section#topics
  .container-md
    .text-center
      h2 Young4Chicks at a Glance
      p.lead.text-muted
        | Here&apos;s what you can expect from Young4Chicks and how it can help you buy and sell
        | poultry with ease.
    .row.my-5.g-5.justify-content-around.align-items-center
      .col-6.col-lg-4
        img.img-fluid(src='/public/images/two-cute-hero.jpg' alt='epig')
      // accordion
      section#topics
        .container-md
          .text-center
            h2 How Young4Chicks Works
            p.lead.text-muted
              | Everything you need to know about buying and selling poultry in one simple
              | platform.
          .row.my-5.g-5.justify-content-around.align-items-center
            .col-6.col-lg-4
              img.img-fluid(src='/public/images/two-cute-hero.jpg' alt='epig')
            // accordion
            .col-6.col-lg-4
              #chapters.accordion
                .accordion-item
                  h2#heading-1.accordion-header
                    button.accordion-button(type='button' data-bs-toggle='collapse' data-bs-target='#chapter-1' aria-expanded='true' aria-controls='chapter-1')
                      | 1. Create Your Account
                  #chapter-1.accordion-collapse.collapse.show(aria-labelledby='heading-1' data-bs-parent='#chapters')
                    .accordion-body
                      p
                        | Join Young4Chicks in minutes! Simply sign up with your email and start exploring our poultry
                        | marketplace. Whether you want to buy chicks for your backyard or sell birds from your farm,
                        | everything starts with a free account.
                      p
                        | Once you&apos;re signed up, you can browse local sellers, check out different chicken breeds, and
                        | see current prices in your area. It&apos;s that simple to get started!
                .accordion-item
                  h2#heading-2.accordion-header
                    button.accordion-button.collapsed(type='button' data-bs-toggle='collapse' data-bs-target='#chapter-2' aria-expanded='false' aria-controls='chapter-2')
                      | 2. Find Your Perfect Chicks
                  #chapter-2.accordion-collapse.collapse(aria-labelledby='heading-2' data-bs-parent='#chapters')
                    .accordion-body
                      p
                        | Looking for specific chicken breeds? Use our search filters to find exactly what you need.
                        | Filter by breed, age, price, and location to discover the perfect birds for your farm or
                        | backyard coop.
                      p
                        | See photos of the chicks, read seller reviews, and compare prices before you buy. Contact
                        | sellers directly through the app to ask questions or arrange pickup times.
                .accordion-item
                  h2#heading-3.accordion-header
                    button.accordion-button.collapsed(type='button' data-bs-toggle='collapse' data-bs-target='#chapter-3' aria-expanded='false' aria-controls='chapter-3')
                      | 3. Sell Your Birds Fast
                  #chapter-3.accordion-collapse.collapse(aria-labelledby='heading-3' data-bs-parent='#chapters')
                    .accordion-body
                      p
                        | Got chickens, ducks, or other poultry to sell? Create your listing in just a few clicks! Add
                        | photos, set your price, and write a short description. Your listing goes live immediately for
                        | local buyers to see.
                      p
                        | Manage all your sales from one dashboard. Track which birds are sold, chat with interested
                        | buyers, and get notifications when someone wants to buy from you.
                .accordion-item
                  h2#heading-4.accordion-header
                    button.accordion-button.collapsed(type='button' data-bs-toggle='collapse' data-bs-target='#chapter-4' aria-expanded='false' aria-controls='chapter-4')
                      | 4. Safe &amp; Easy Payments
                  #chapter-4.accordion-collapse.collapse(aria-labelledby='heading-4' data-bs-parent='#chapters')
                    .accordion-body
                      p
                        | All payments are secure and protected. Buy with confidence knowing your money is safe, and
                        | sell knowing you&apos;ll get paid quickly. We use trusted payment methods that work for everyone.
                      p
                        | Both buyers and sellers are protected. If there&apos;s ever an issue, our support team is ready to
                        | help resolve any problems quickly and fairly.
                .accordion-item
                  h2#heading-5.accordion-header
                    button.accordion-button.collapsed(type='button' data-bs-toggle='collapse' data-bs-target='#chapter-5' aria-expanded='false' aria-controls='chapter-5')
                      | 5. Get Help Anytime
                  #chapter-5.accordion-collapse.collapse(aria-labelledby='heading-5' data-bs-parent='#chapters')
                    .accordion-body
                      p
                        | New to raising chickens? No problem! We have guides on chicken care, feeding tips, and coop
                        | setup. Plus, our friendly community is always ready to share advice.
                      p
                        | Need technical help with the app? Our support team responds fast to help you with any
                        | questions about buying, selling, or using Young4Chicks.
      footer.whole-footer
        .container
          .row.text-center.text-md-start
            .container.mb-3.text-center
              h3 Quick Links
            ul.container.list-unstyled.text-center
              li
                a.text-white(href='index.html') Home
              li
                a.text-white(href='about.html') About
              li
                a.text-white(href='chick-request-form.html') Chicks
              li
                a.text-white(href='login.html') Login
              li
                a.text-white(href='farmer-reg-page.html') Register
